 begin="19.000" end="19.240">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.240" end="19.480">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">混</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.480" end="19.830">ご</span></span></span><span begin="19.830" end="20.180">み</span><span begin="20.180" end="20.550">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.550" end="21.330">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.330" end="21.520">か</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">昨日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.520" end="21.750">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.750" end="22.101">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.101" end="22.440">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.440" end="22.832">み</span></span></span><span begin="22.832" end="23.190">て</span><span begin="23.190" end="23.590">い</span><span begin="23.590" end="24.300">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在人潮之中 望见了昨日</span></p><p begin="25.050" end="29.900" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">傷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.050" end="25.280">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.280" end="25.440">ず</span></span></span><span begin="25.440" end="25.830">つ</span><span begin="25.830" end="26.200">く</span><span begin="26.200" end="26.590">こ</span><span begin="26.590" end="26.930">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.930" end="27.300">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">付</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.300" end="27.500"> づ</span></span></span><span begin="27.500" end="27.740">か</span><span begin="27.740" end="28.100">な</span><span begin="28.100" end="28.420">い</span><span begin="28.420" end="28.860">フ</span><span begin="28.860" end="29.140">リ</span><span begin="29.140" end="29.570">し</span><span begin="29.570" end="29.900">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装不曾察觉受到的伤</span></p><p begin="30.130" end="35.530" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.130" end="30.540">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.540" end="31.240">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.240" end="31.950">お</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">作</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.950" end="32.740">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.740" end="33.250">く</span></span></span><span begin="33.250" end="33.520">る</span><span begin="33.520" end="33.720">の</span><span begin="33.720" end="34.490">は</span><span begin="34.770" end="35.150">な</span><span begin="35.150" end="35.520">ぜ</span><span begin="35.520" end="35.530">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何还要故作笑颜</span></p><p begin="35.920" end="47.050" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">揺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.920" end="36.510">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="36.510" end="37.770">れ</span><span begin="37.770" end="38.790">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.120" end="39.530">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.530" end="40.560">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.560" end="40.900">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="40.900" end="41.720">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.970" end="42.350">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.350" end="43.830">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.830" end="44.850">た</span></span></span><span begin="45.120" end="45.500">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">描</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.500" end="45.660">え</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.660" end="45.870">が</span></span></span><span begin="45.870" end="46.050">け</span><span begin="46.050" end="47.050">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若在摇曳的心中描绘出明天</span></p><p begin="47.800" end="53.400" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.800" end="48.120">そ</span><span begin="48.120" end="48.510">う</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">高</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.510" end="49.070">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.070" end="49.600">か</span></span></span><span begin="49.600" end="51.170">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.530" end="52.140">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.140" end="52.620">お</span></span></span><span begin="52.620" end="53.400">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定能向着高远之处</span></p><p begin="53.600" end="1:00.250" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.600" end="53.791">き</span><span begin="53.791" end="53.970">っ</span><span begin="53.970" end="54.450">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">羽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.450" end="55.070">は</span></span></span><span begin="55.070" end="55.620">ば</span><span begin="55.620" end="56.040">た</span><span begin="56.040" end="56.570">い</span><span begin="56.570" end="57.150">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.150" end="57.490">い</span></span></span><span begin="57.490" end="58.430">け</span><span begin="58.640" end="58.990">る</span><span begin="58.990" end="59.780">か</span><span begin="59.780" end="1:00.250">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展翅飞翔而去</span></p><p begin="1:00.500" end="1:13.070" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.500" end="1:01.100">ど</span><span begin="1:01.100" end="1:01.620">う</span><span begin="1:01.620" end="1:03.250">か</span><span begin="1:03.520" end="1:04.090">あ</span><span begin="1:04.090" end="1:04.620">な</span><span begin="1:04.620" end="1:05.760">た</span><span begin="1:05.760" end="1:06.290">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.290" end="1:06.920">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.920" end="1:07.130">も</span></span></span><span begin="1:07.130" end="1:08.010">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">届</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.010" end="1:08.610">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.610" end="1:09.130">ど</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.130" end="1:09.550">け</span><span begin="1:09.550" end="1:10.670">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.020" end="1:11.660">ほ</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.660" end="1:12.510">し</span><span begin="1:12.510" end="1:13.070">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿这份思念 能够传达给你</span></p><p begin="1:25.090" end="1:30.110" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.090" end="1:25.100">「</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">振</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.100" end="1:25.280">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.280" end="1:25.470">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">向</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.470" end="1:25.830">む</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.830" end="1:26.160">け</span><span begin="1:26.160" end="1:26.580">ば</span><span begin="1:26.580" end="1:27.280">い</span><span begin="1:27.280" end="1:27.480">つ</span><span begin="1:27.480" end="1:27.650">も</span><span begin="1:27.650" end="1:28.100">そ</span><span begin="1:28.100" end="1:28.480">こ</span><span begin="1:28.480" end="1:28.850">に</span><span begin="1:28.850" end="1:29.170">い</span><span begin="1:29.170" end="1:30.100">る</span><span begin="1:30.100" end="1:30.110">」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「只要回头，总是在那」</span></p><p begin="1:31.040" end="1:36.350" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">普</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.040" end="1:31.220">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">通</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.220" end="1:31.460">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.460" end="1:31.840">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.840" end="1:32.190">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.190" end="1:32.530">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.530" end="1:33.110">も</span></span></span><span begin="1:33.110" end="1:33.540">う</span><span begin="1:33.540" end="1:33.730">の</span><span begin="1:33.730" end="1:34.050">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.050" end="1:34.450">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.450" end="1:34.760">が</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.760" end="1:34.870">っ</span><span begin="1:34.870" end="1:35.200">て</span><span begin="1:35.200" end="1:35.580">い</span><span begin="1:35.580" end="1:36.350">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当作理所当然 却搞错了</span></p><p begin="1:37.070" end="1:41.920" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.070" end="1:37.260">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">安</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.260" end="1:37.510">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.510" end="1:37.850">ん</span></span></span><span begin="1:37.850" end="1:38.190">な</span><span begin="1:38.190" end="1:38.590">こ</span><span begin="1:38.590" end="1:38.940">と</span><span begin="1:38.940" end="1:39.240">き</span><span begin="1:39.240" end="1:39.340">っ</span><span begin="1:39.340" end="1:39.510">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.510" end="1:39.730">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.730" end="1:40.060">え</span><span begin="1:40.060" end="1:40.450">て</span><span begin="1:40.450" end="1:40.790">い</span><span begin="1:40.790" end="1:41.200">く</span><span begin="1:41.200" end="1:41.550">か</span><span begin="1:41.550" end="1:41.920">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中的不安 我一定会亲手改变</span></p><p begin="1:42.140" end="1:47.580" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.140" end="1:42.540">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.540" end="1:43.150">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.150" end="1:44.030">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:44.030" end="1:44.780">の</span><span begin="1:44.780" end="1:45.300">こ</span><span begin="1:45.300" end="1:45.510">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.510" end="1:45.710">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:45.710" end="1:46.560">つ</span><span begin="1:46.820" end="1:47.200">け</span><span begin="1:47.200" end="1:47.580">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请一定要找到我</span></p><p begin="1:47.920" end="1:59.070" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.920" end="1:48.520">わ</span><span begin="1:48.520" end="1:49.840">ざ</span><span begin="1:49.840" end="1:50.860">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">試</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.140" end="1:51.500">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.500" end="1:52.520">め</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.520" end="1:52.830">し</span><span begin="1:52.830" end="1:53.700">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.970" end="1:54.520">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.520" end="1:55.730">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.730" end="1:56.870">ば</span></span></span><span begin="1:57.150" end="1:57.500">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">許</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.500" end="1:57.740">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.740" end="1:57.860">る</span></span></span><span begin="1:57.860" end="1:58.060">し</span><span begin="1:58.060" end="1:59.070">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请原谅那些故意的试探</span></p><p begin="1:59.760" end="2:05.360" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.760" end="2:00.100">そ</span><span begin="2:00.100" end="2:00.410">う</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">広</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.410" end="2:01.060">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.060" end="2:01.630">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:01.630" end="2:03.330">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">強</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.330" end="2:04.022">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.022" end="2:04.630">よ</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.630" end="2:05.360">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要更加宽广而坚强地</span></p><p begin="2:05.580" end="2:12.220" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.580" end="2:05.750">も</span><span begin="2:05.750" end="2:05.920">っ</span><span begin="2:05.920" end="2:06.490">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">腕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.490" end="2:07.110">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.110" end="2:07.610">で</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">広</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.610" end="2:08.030">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.030" end="2:08.590">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.590" end="2:09.140">げ</span><span begin="2:09.140" end="2:09.520">れ</span><span begin="2:09.520" end="2:10.270">ば</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.670" end="2:11.010">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:11.010" end="2:11.761">け</span><span begin="2:11.761" end="2:12.220">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">张开双臂 便能勇往直前</span></p><p begin="2:12.450" end="2:25.200" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.450" end="2:13.049">む</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.049" end="2:13.640">ね</span></span></span><span begin="2:13.640" end="2:15.310">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">隠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.550" end="2:16.111">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.111" end="2:16.630">く</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.630" end="2:17.750">し</span><span begin="2:17.750" end="2:18.280">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">願</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.500" end="2:18.900">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.900" end="2:19.130">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.130" end="2:19.630">い</span><span begin="2:19.630" end="2:19.980">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">叶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.980" end="2:20.600">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.600" end="2:21.140">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.140" end="2:21.500">え</span><span begin="2:21.500" end="2:22.630">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.000" end="2:23.600">ほ</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.600" end="2:24.510">し</span><span begin="2:24.510" end="2:25.200">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请让深藏在心底的愿望实现</span></p><p begin="2:51.540" end="3:03.250" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.540" end="2:52.110">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.110" end="2:52.630">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.630" end="2:54.230">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">祈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.540" end="2:55.090">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.090" end="2:55.680">の</span></span></span><span begin="2:55.680" end="2:56.390">り</span><span begin="2:56.530" end="2:56.790">そ</span><span begin="2:56.790" end="2:57.000">っ</span><span begin="2:57.000" end="2:57.480">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:57.480" end="2:58.082">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.082" end="2:58.520">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:58.520" end="2:58.980">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.980" end="2:59.540">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.540" end="3:00.120">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.120" end="3:00.450">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:00.450" end="3:01.290">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">包</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.640" end="3:01.999">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.999" end="3:02.810">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.810" end="3:03.250">み</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让怀抱中的祈祷轻轻包住滑落的泪水</span></p><p begin="3:03.540" end="3:15.300" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">照</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.540" end="3:04.090">て</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.090" end="3:04.540">ら</span><span begin="3:04.540" end="3:06.240">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:06.500" end="3:07.050">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.050" end="3:07.610">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.610" end="3:08.790">り</span></span></span><span begin="3:08.790" end="3:09.300">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">眠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.520" end="3:09.890">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.890" end="3:10.110">む</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.110" end="3:10.589">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">闇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.589" end="3:10.990">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.990" end="3:11.580">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:11.580" end="3:12.130">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">癒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.130" end="3:12.530">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.530" end="3:13.650">や</span></span></span><span begin="3:13.960" end="3:14.760">し</span><span begin="3:14.760" end="3:15.300">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让照耀的光芒 治愈那片沉睡的黑暗</span></p><p begin="3:15.500" end="3:27.250" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">走</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.500" end="3:15.909">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.909" end="3:16.661">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:16.661" end="3:18.240">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.570" end="3:19.040">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:19.040" end="3:19.640">し</span><span begin="3:19.640" end="3:20.440">て</span> <span begin="3:20.440" end="3:20.690">そ</span><span begin="3:20.690" end="3:20.950">し</span><span begin="3:20.950" end="3:21.470">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.470" end="3:22.060">て</span></span></span><span begin="3:22.060" end="3:22.620">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:22.620" end="3:23.030">て</span></span></span><span begin="3:23.030" end="3:23.550">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">取</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.550" end="3:24.129">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:24.129" end="3:24.540">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">合</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.540" end="3:25.350">あ</span></span></span><span begin="3:25.650" end="3:26.021">え</span><span begin="3:26.021" end="3:26.770">れ</span><span begin="3:26.770" end="3:27.250">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此奔跑启程 若手牵着手</span></p><p begin="3:27.520" end="3:40.120" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">永遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.520" end="3:28.080">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.080" end="3:28.640">わ</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.640" end="3:30.160">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">二人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.530" end="3:31.050">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.050" end="3:31.660">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.660" end="3:32.770">り</span></span></span><span begin="3:32.770" end="3:33.530">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">未</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.530" end="3:33.900">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.900" end="3:34.140">ら</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.140" end="3:34.610">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:34.610" end="3:34.950">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.950" end="3:35.600">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.600" end="3:36.150">む</span></span></span><span begin="3:36.150" end="3:36.520">い</span><span begin="3:36.520" end="3:37.580">で</span><span begin="3:38.040" end="3:38.720">い</span><span begin="3:38.720" end="3:39.500">く</span><span begin="3:39.500" end="3:40.120">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人便能永远把未来编织下去</span></p></div></body></tt>